<title>ITALY: Italy's Repubblica launches internet site.</title>
<headline>Italy's Repubblica launches internet site.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian newspaper La Repubblica reported on Wednesday that the launch of an on-line newspaper on the worldwide web of the internet had attracted 500,000 readers on its first day.</p>
<p>La Repubblica said the site, located at http://www.repubblica.it, had been launched on January 14, the 21st anniversary of the newspaper's birth.</p>
<p>The peak hour was between 1000 and 1100 gmt when the site attracted more than 60,000 connections, La Repubblica said.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
